        is_verified=True,
        requirements=["Meet the general Chevening Fellowship eligibility criteria and all programme-specific requirements.", "Apply through the Chevening online application system reached from the relevant European country/territory page.", "Demonstrate five years' (7,200 hours) of relevant professional experience, calculated automatically from the weeks and hours you enter.", "Ensure the employing organisation will release you for the six-week programme: 'it is your responsibility to ensure that they will release you if you are selected for a Chevening Fellowship. The British embassy/high commission or the Chevening Secretariat cannot intervene in this.'", "Secure and comply with the UK entry clearance (visa) requirements applicable to the fellowship, including medical clearance.", "On return of the acceptance form, agree to abide by the Chevening Fellowship terms and conditions for the duration of the award."],
        selection_notes="Chevening publishes the four general Fellowship objectives - supporting mid-career professionals in positions of leadership and influence, offering dynamic training/professional development/research relevant to professional interests and UK international strategic priorities, increasing the breadth and diversity of Chevening awards, and supporting FCDO foreign policy priorities by creating lasting relationships with future leaders, influencers and decision-makers. For this programme the assessment is against the general Chevening Fellowship criteria plus the published programme-specific requirements, and against the needs of a cohort drawn from the listed European countries. Chevening Fellowships are 'an important element of Britain's public diplomacy effort', and fellows are active in their field or subject. Chevening does not publish a separate scoring framework or interview format for this programme; applications for Chevening Scholarships follow the published sifting, reading committee, embassy shortlist and interview stages, while Chevening states that 'Application timelines for Chevening Fellowships vary.'",
