        coverage=["Full tuition fees for a one-year UK master's degree at the university of the scholar's choice", "A monthly stipend, stated in the Final Award Letter, which Chevening says is intended to cover all living costs including accommodation", "Return flights between the nearest airport in the home country and the nearest airport to the UK university, booked by Chevening's designated travel agency, where confirmed in the Final Award Letter", "Student visa application fee and Immigration Health Surcharge ('you don't need to pay the visa fee or the Immigration Health Surcharge')", "Arrival allowance where confirmed in the Final Award Letter", "Departure allowance for scholars on a full award", "A travel grant"],
