        selection_notes="Coordinators choose the research axis and thus the scientific evaluation committee at submission; the choice cannot be changed during the selection process. PRCE step 1 registrations that meet the step 1 eligibility criteria receive an automatic invitation to step 2 without assessment of the scientific value of the registration by the scientific evaluation committees. Step 1 results are notified to coordinators mid-February 2027; a right of reply to reviews opens on IRIS in week 20 of May 2027; the list of projects selected for funding is published in July 2027. PRCI selection requires joint agreement of both funding agencies, each of which ultimately funds the teams of its own country.",
